30
00:03:31,515 --> 00:03:43,336
And in object orientation, it is a means of creating a new class from an existing class so that it is similar with the real world.

31
00:03:43,728 --> 00:03:50,627
Remember that we are trying to model the real-world objects and their relationships in our code.

32
00:03:50,627 --> 00:04:10,548
So if there is some dependency between two objects that first one, an existing one, inherits every genetic property, every property, which means every member.

33
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:14,799
