174
00:23:03,560 --> 00:23:10,040
This is an all working and nice button class.

175
00:23:10,600 --> 00:23:14,360
You have written your code by using that group.

176
00:23:14,420 --> 00:23:16,580
Class and show it to your customer.

177
00:23:17,140 --> 00:23:24,240
Then your customer says, well, we are an enterprise and we have some company colors.

178
00:23:24,900 --> 00:23:32,120
