179
00:23:32,820 --> 00:23:34,560
We have those.

180
00:23:34,860 --> 00:23:38,560
We want to have those colored buttons.

181
00:23:39,859 --> 00:23:46,740
All right, the customer is always right, but how to create those new buttons?

182
00:23:47,619 --> 00:23:55,579
At first, you can think that, well, I already have a GUI button class, but it's gray and boring.

183
